  <goal>
    `model1-shared.bicep` / `model1-customer.bicep` and everything that references them are gone, the build and the Bicep
    E2E dry run are green with three stacks, the ARM-artifact workflow no longer compiles or uploads `model1-shared`, and
    H2a's manifest schema no longer requires it. No Bicep path provisions a shared Model 1 identity, RG or service.
  </goal>

  <knowledge>
